  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "2. In a blender or food processor, combine lemongrass paste, ginger paste, garlic, fish sauce, palm sugar, coriander, and cilantro. Blend until smooth.",
    "3. Cut chicken breast into 1-inch pieces and thread onto skewers.",
    "4. Brush coconut oil onto the skewers and season with salt and pepper.",
    "5. Grill the skewers for 8-10 minutes, turning every 2 minutes, until cooked through.",
    "6. Brush the skewers with lemongrass paste mixture during the last 2 minutes of grilling.",
    "7. Garnish with chopped cilantro and serve with a squeeze of lime juice.",
    "8. Serve immediately and enjoy!"
  ],
